//
// Sources: Weibel, The K-book (2013); Milnor, Introduction to Algebraic K-Theory (1971); Rosenberg, Algebraic K-Theory
// and its Applications (1994); Quillen, Higher algebraic K-theory I (1973); Atiyah, K-Theory (1967); Hatcher, Vector
// Bundles and K-Theory; Karoubi, K-Theory (1978); Blackadar, K-Theory for Operator Algebras (1998); Lück and Reich,
// The Baum–Connes and the Farrell–Jones conjectures in K- and L-theory (2005). Not checked by a specialist.
// Checked by ../../tests/check-theorems.js.

