      proof: "The index map of the Toeplitz extension 0 → 𝒦 → 𝒯 → C(S<sup>1</sup>) → 0 sends the generator of K<sub>1</sub>(C(S<sup>1</sup>)) to the generator of K<sub>0</sub>(𝒦) = ℤ (index of the unilateral shift); Cuntz shows that the K-theory of the Toeplitz algebra tensored with A equals that of A, which yields periodicity. The Fredholm theory of Toeplitz operators lies outside these graphs.",
